      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define bond inputs\n    coupon_rate = 0.03\n    yield_to_maturity = 0.05\n    years_to_maturity = 9\n    par_value = 100.0\n    dirty_price = 85.784357\n\n    # Calculate Macaulay duration from the annual coupon cash flows\n    coupon = coupon_rate * par_value\n    weighted_present_value = 0.0\n\n    for year in range(1, years_to_maturity + 1):\n        cash_flow = coupon + (par_value if year == years_to_maturity else 0.0)\n        present_value = cash_flow / (1 + yield_to_maturity) ** year\n        weighted_present_value += year * present_value\n\n    macaulay_duration = weighted_present_value / dirty_price\n    modified_duration = macaulay_duration / (1 + yield_to_maturity)\n\n    # Calculate PVBP and round to three decimal places\n    answer = round(modified_duration * dirty_price * 0.0001, 3)\n\n    # Return answer\n    return answer\n```",
